# NablaMimic on the pinned MuJoCo Warp SDK fork (scripts/setup_mujoco_warp.sh) with residual actions, configs/ours.args on
# the other simulator, 3 h of training. The backward uses the same gradient conventions as NablaEngine (self-contact
# normal held constant below 1 mm, segment parameters of near-parallel capsules held constant), plus the
# scaled right-hand side in the SDK adjoint's IFT solve; the two simulators' forward passes are separate
# implementations. The absolute-action recipe of the reported comparisons: configs/reported/ours_absolute_mjw.args.
# the v0.1.0 recipe (base/ours_v1.args)
@base/ours_v1.args
--physics warp --mjw-adj-normal 3 --mjw-adj-parallel 1 --mjw-ift-solve 1 --residual-action
--hours 3
